  "strings": [
    "Osgiliath shall play yet another part in this war.\u0000",
    "Faramir brought the Ringbearer here...\u0000",
    "but wisely allowed him to continue his quest.\u0000",
    "Now a garrison of Gondor's defenders keep watch, ever wary.\u0000",
    "The warriors that hold this outpost secretly hope for\u0000",
    "Faramir and his Ithilien Rangers to return at dawn.\u0000",
    "But the ranks of the Orcs continue to swell...\u0000",
    "and hope alone is but a flimsy shield.\u0000",
    "Silence shrouds the far shore of the Anduin\u0000",
    "as the defenders of Osgiliath are left alone to sharpen their fears.\u0000",
    "In the gathering darkness\u0000",
    "dawn cannot arrive swiftly enough for these brave men of Gondor.\u0000"
  ]
